    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d447-a1">

                <pb facs="1239" n="1089" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg1089"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to Minister
                        O’Brien.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-03-01"><hi rendition="#italic">March 1,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: I have the satisfaction of
                    notifying Your Excellency that the citizen, Dr. Claudio Williman,
                    President-elect of the Republic, has just taken <pb facs="1240" n="1090"
                        xml:id="pg1090"/> possession of the supreme command of the State after
                    taking oath, which the constitution prescribes, before the honorable General
                    Assembly.</p>
                <p>For the time that the ministry is not properly constituted His Excellency the
                    President of the Republic has charged the oflciales mayores of the respective
                    folios.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Miguel A.
                    Flangini.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
